n a food close-up with no real venue branding or location context.","fix":"Keep the CTA, but pair it with a stronger branded end card treatment or a cleaner final frame that reads as intentional brand communication."},{"severity":"MEDIUM","category":"Pacing","timestamp_seconds":12,"problem":"The last 3 seconds are spent on an almost static salmon-handling shot that adds little new information.","fix":"Shorten the hold and let the reel resolve faster into the final bite/reaction or CTA."}]
